WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.928
A team picture should help you decide where

00:00:02.928 --> 00:00:05.506
to look next, without losing the people and

00:00:05.506 --> 00:00:06.473
work behind it.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:09.852
Open Team with your leadership role. Confirm which

00:00:09.852 --> 00:00:12.831
unit you are viewing and what your membership

00:00:12.831 --> 00:00:14.321
allows you to see.

00:00:14.721 --> 00:00:18.068
Use the shared records and available team views

00:00:18.068 --> 00:00:21.415
to understand the work. Select a person or

00:00:21.415 --> 00:00:24.343
outcome when you need the supporting detail.

00:00:24.743 --> 00:00:27.904
Before acting on a summary, open the source.

00:00:27.904 --> 00:00:31.064
Look for the owner, the status, and the

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:33.830
context that explains what still needs attention.

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:37.780
This view reflects the records and permissions available

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:41.329
here. Missing or unshared records are a visibility

00:00:41.329 --> 00:00:44.435
limit, not a measure of someone’s effort.

00:00:44.835 --> 00:00:48.336
Confirm the scope, inspect the source, and make

00:00:48.336 --> 00:00:50.524
the next conversation more informed.
